hemo:1000051 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "takes weight from"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000125 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Relates a variable to the HEAO valuation weight, or the record typed as one, whose value it takes, such as a utility variable taking a preference-based utility weight. It names where the value comes from and applies no weight, so it is representational."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Use this object property from a variable to the one HEAO weight or record that supplies its value, as in a worked example. Use the annotation property takes weight of type from a variable to the kind of HEAO weight, in the catalogue."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000117 "Michelle Ashley (drafted with Claude)" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "Ashley M. HEMO 0.2.0 decisions, the recommended options of design section 12, 18 October 2026; Baines D, Ashley M. Curator decisions on the HEMO 0.2.0 reviews, 19 October 2026" ;
