    heao:9000001 heao:4000002 .

hemo:1000052 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "encodes causal claim"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000125 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Relates a variable or an expression to the RHEO record that holds a causal claim the term carries, such as a relative risk applied to a progression probability and the relative effect estimate behind it. HEMO marks the term and RHEO holds the claim. Both ends are records, so the relationship is representational, not causal."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Use this object property from a variable to the one RHEO record that holds the claim, as in a worked example. Use the annotation property carries causal claim held by from a variable to the kind of RHEO record, in the catalogue."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000117 "Michelle Ashley (drafted with Claude)" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "Ashley M. HEMO 0.2.0 decisions, the recommended options of design section 12, 18 October 2026; Baines D, Ashley M. Curator decisions on the HEMO 0.2.0 reviews, 19 October 2026" ;
