    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000125 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Relates a variable of a catalogue record to the unit of measure a named rule of src/unit-lookup.csv proposes from the module's unit text, not yet reviewed. It becomes has unit of measure once a curator reviews the rule."@en ;
