    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000125 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "The currency and price year of a variable of money written as a dimension vector, cur.X yr.y for an amount in currency X at the prices of year y, cur.Z cur.X-1 for a conversion factor in units of Z per unit of X, and yr.y for a price index of year y, which the money rule of the test runner reads."@en ;
